          <q1:parameter uniqueID="UID_OBJ_600B">
            <description lang="en">Calibration values (gain and offset) for the 2 general purpose channels of the ADC, as well as the calibration values for each of the resistor ranges used to measure impedances.

Calibration is done at startup using precision reference voltages and resistors.
</description>
            <q1:dataTypeIDRef uniqueIDRef="UID_REC_600B" />
